/**
 * Missions, plugged into the game (docs/missions.html). main.ts builds one of these and calls it from a
 * handful of places — the frame, the J key, a delivery, a ferry, a town or a wonder reached, the save —
 * and everything else lives here: the director and its list (missions.ts), the card, the journal, the
 * tracker, a race or a tow when one is running, the rewards, and the town standing's effects.
 */
